  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "Given equation: 13 + 9 ÷ 78 × 27 - 16 = 3.\n\nBODMAS Table:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) 3 and 78\n\nGiven: 13 + 9 ÷ 78 × 27 - 16 = 3\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 13 + __**9 ÷ 3**__ × 27 - 16 = 78\n\n⇒ 13 + __**3 × 27**__ - 16 = 78\n\n⇒ __**13 + 81**__ - 16 = 78\n\n⇒ __**94 - 16**__ = 78\n\n⇒ **78 = 78**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 2) 78 and 27\n\nGiven: 13 + 9 ÷ 78 × 27 - 16 = 3\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 13 + __**9 ÷ 27**__ × 78 - 16 = 3\n\n⇒ 13 + __**0.333 × 78**__ - 16 = 3\n\n⇒ __**13 + 25.994**__ - 16 = 3\n\n⇒ __**38.994 - 16**__ = 3\n\n⇒ 22.994 ≠ 3\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) 13 and 78\n\nGiven: 13 + 9 ÷ 78 × 27 - 16 = 3\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 78 + __**9 ÷ 13**__ × 27 - 16 = 3\n\n⇒ 78 + __**0.692 × 27**__ - 16 = 3\n\n⇒ __**78 + 18.684**__ - 16 = 3\n\n⇒ __**96.684 - 16**__ = 3\n\n⇒ 80.684 ≠ 3\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) 27 and 16\n\nGiven: 13 + 9 ÷ 78 × 27 - 16 = 3\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 13 + __**9 ÷ 78**__ × 16 - 27 = 3\n\n⇒ 13 + __**0.115 × 16**__ - 27 = 3\n\n⇒ __**13 + 1.84**__ - 27 = 3\n\n⇒ __**14.84 - 27**__ = 3\n\n⇒ -12.16 ≠ 3\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 1\"**.",
